        <mxCell id="notes_t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="NOTES" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="16" width="200" x="52" y="1476" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="1. Single-owner rule: only radiod opens OpenCPI. All other processes use librc (ICD-2). Never a second ACI instance." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="1150" x="52" y="1496" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="2. REDHAWK CF sits ABOVE radiod: the Domain/Device Managers reach hardware only through librc, so Note 1 is preserved." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="1150" x="52" y="1516" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="3. ORB threads never call the MANET stack directly. They enqueue; hh_node_tick() drains. Keeps the single-threaded, no-locks invariant." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="1150" x="52" y="1536" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="4. Data contract ICD-1: one PDU = one descriptor = one skb; TLAST marks PDU boundary; length carried in descriptor, not in payload." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="1150" x="52" y="1556" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="5. MANET STROBE from mac_pl is the sole RF state authority; rf_ctrl_fsm may only add safety (interlock), never contradict it." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="1150" x="52" y="1576" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
